          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਕੰਮ is familiar “work.” ਕੀਤਾ is the familiar completed form in ਮੈਂ ਕੰਮ ਕੀਤਾ. In that old frame it agrees with the unmarked work object. Keep those pieces ready; the next lesson adds one small marker to a named person's completed action."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
